1
00:00:20,057 --> 00:00:22,057
Shit.

2
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:45,520
No… no…

3
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:48,760
That's not Earth.

4
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:53,360
Or…

5
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:56,840
Could it actually be true?

6
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,000
Night.

7
00:01:30,977 --> 00:01:32,823
I knew you'd call.

8
00:01:33,995 --> 00:01:35,639
Did I smash Base's face in?

9
00:01:37,457 --> 00:01:38,728
You don't remember anything?

10
00:01:39,391 --> 00:01:42,250
If I remembered,
would I be calling you, Night?

11
00:01:42,590 --> 00:01:44,609
Earth was the one who stopped you.

12
00:01:45,255 --> 00:01:46,031
Ring any bells?

13
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:49,739
Earth… Earth…

14
00:01:50,928 --> 00:01:52,570
Earth? Which Earth?

15
00:01:54,286 --> 00:01:55,690
Earth.

16
00:01:56,472 --> 00:01:57,974
My dad's wife's kid?

17
00:01:58,943 --> 00:02:00,428
Why are you shocked?

18
00:02:00,666 --> 00:02:03,561
Yeah, that one.

19
00:02:03,850 --> 00:02:09,505
So what the hell
was that kid doing there?
